{
  "id": "EXO.12",
  "number": "12",
  "bookId": "EXO",
  "reference": "Exodus 12",
  "verseCount": 51,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "12",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "EXO 12"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "12",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 12:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.12.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " said to Moses and Aaron in the land of Egypt, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.12.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 12:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“This month shall be for you the beginning of months; it shall be the first month of the year for you. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.12.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 12:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tell all the congregation of Israel that on the tenth day of this month they shall take every man a lamb according to their fathers' houses, a lamb for a household; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.12.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 12:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and if the household is too small for a lamb, then a man and his neighbor next to his house shall take according to the number of persons; according to what each can eat you shall make your count for the lamb. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.12.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 12:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Your lamb shall be without blemish, a male a year old; you shall take it from the sheep or from the goats; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.12.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 12:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and you shall keep it until the fourteenth day of this month, when the whole assembly of the congregation of Israel shall kill their lambs in the evening.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.12.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12.6",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Heb",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "between the two evenings",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.12.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 12:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then they shall take some of the blood, and put it on the two doorposts and the lintel of the houses in which they eat them. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.12.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 12:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They shall eat the flesh that night, roasted; with unleavened bread and bitter herbs they shall eat it. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.12.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 12:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Do not eat any of it raw or boiled with water, but roasted, its head with its legs and its inner parts. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.12.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 12:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And you shall let none of it remain until the morning, anything that remains until the morning you shall burn. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.12.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 12:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "In this manner you shall eat it: your loins girded, your sandals on your feet, and your staff in your hand; and you shall eat it in haste. It is the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.12.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "'s passover. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.12.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 12:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For I will pass through the land of Egypt that night, and I will smite all the first-born in the land of Egypt, both man and beast; and on all the gods of Egypt I will execute judgments: I am the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.12.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ". ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.12.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 12:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "HEB.11.28"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Heb 11.28",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " The blood shall be a sign for you, upon the houses where you are; and when I see the blood, I will pass over you, and no plague shall fall upon you to destroy you, when I smite the land of Egypt.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.12.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 12:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.12.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 12:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“This day shall be for you a memorial day, and you shall keep it as a feast to the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.12.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "; throughout your generations you shall observe it as an ordinance for ever. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.12.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 12:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Seven days you shall eat unleavened bread; on the first day you shall put away leaven out of your houses, for if any one eats what is leavened, from the first day until the seventh day, that person shall be cut off from Israel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.12.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 12:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "On the first day you shall hold a holy assembly, and on the seventh day a holy assembly; no work shall be done on those days; but what every one must eat, that only may be prepared by you. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.12.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 12:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And you shall observe the feast of unleavened bread, for on this very day I brought your hosts out of the land of Egypt: therefore you shall observe this day, throughout your generations, as an ordinance for ever. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.12.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 12:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "In the first month, on the fourteenth day of the month at evening, you shall eat unleavened bread, and so until the twenty-first day of the month at evening. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.12.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 12:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For seven days no leaven shall be found in your houses; for if any one eats what is leavened, that person shall be cut off from the congregation of Israel, whether he is a sojourner or a native of the land. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.12.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 12:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "You shall eat nothing leavened; in all your dwellings you shall eat unleavened bread.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.12.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 12:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.12.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 12:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then Moses called all the elders of Israel, and said to them, “Select lambs for yourselves according to your families, and kill the passover lamb. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.12.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 12:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Take a bunch of hyssop and dip it in the blood which is in the basin, and touch the lintel and the two doorposts with the blood which is in the basin; and none of you shall go out of the door of his house until the morning. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.12.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 12:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.12.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " will pass through to slay the Egyptians; and when he sees the blood on the lintel and on the two doorposts, the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.12.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " will pass over the door, and will not allow the destroyer to enter your houses to slay you. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.12.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 12:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "You shall observe this rite as an ordinance for you and for your sons for ever. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.12.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 12:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And when you come to the land which the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.12.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " will give you, as he has promised, you shall keep this service. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.12.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 12:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And when your children say to you, ‘What do you mean by this service?’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.12.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 12:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "you shall say, ‘It is the sacrifice of the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.12.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "'s passover, for he passed over the houses of the people of Israel in Egypt, when he slew the Egyptians but spared our houses.’ ” And the people bowed their heads and worshiped.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.12.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 12:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.12.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 12:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then the people of Israel went and did so; as the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.12.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " had commanded Moses and Aaron, so they did.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.12.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 12:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.12.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 12:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "At midnight the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.12.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " smote all the first-born in the land of Egypt, from the first-born of Pharaoh who sat on his throne to the first-born of the captive who was in the dungeon, and all the first-born of the cattle. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.12.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 12:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And Pharaoh rose up in the night, he, and all his servants, and all the Egyptians; and there was a great cry in Egypt, for there was not a house where one was not dead. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.12.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 12:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And he summoned Moses and Aaron by night, and said, “Rise up, go forth from among my people, both you and the people of Israel; and go, serve the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.12.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", as you have said. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.12.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 12:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Take your flocks and your herds, as you have said, and be gone; and bless me also!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.12.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 12:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.12.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 12:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the Egyptians were urgent with the people, to send them out of the land in haste; for they said, “We are all dead men.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.12.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 12:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So the people took their dough before it was leavened, their kneading bowls being bound up in their mantles on their shoulders. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.12.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 12:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The people of Israel had also done as Moses told them, for they had asked of the Egyptians jewelry of silver and gold, and clothing; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.12.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 12:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.12.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " had given the people favor in the sight of the Egyptians, so that they let them have what they asked. Thus they despoiled the Egyptians.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.12.36"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 12:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.12.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 12:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the people of Israel journeyed from Rameses to Succoth, about six hundred thousand men on foot, besides women and children. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.12.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 12:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A mixed multitude also went up with them, and very many cattle, both flocks and herds. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.12.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 12:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And they baked unleavened cakes of the dough which they had brought out of Egypt, for it was not leavened, because they were thrust out of Egypt and could not tarry, neither had they prepared for themselves any provisions.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.12.39"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
