          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.7.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Acts 7.6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " The time that the people of Israel dwelt in Egypt was four hundred and thirty years. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.12.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 12:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And at the end of four hundred and thirty years, on that very day, all the hosts of the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.12.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " went out from the land of Egypt. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.12.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 12:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "It was a night of watching by the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.12.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", to bring them out of the land of Egypt; so this same night is a night of watching kept to the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.12.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " by all the people of Israel throughout their generations.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.12.42"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
