        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.12.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 12:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.12.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " said to Moses and Aaron, “This is the ordinance of the passover: no foreigner shall eat of it; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.12.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 12:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "but every slave that is bought for money may eat of it after you have circumcised him. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.12.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 12:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "No sojourner or hired servant may eat of it. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.12.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 12:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.9.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Num 9.12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JHN.19.36"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Jn 19.36",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " In one house shall it be eaten; you shall not carry forth any of the flesh outside the house; and you shall not break a bone of it. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.12.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 12:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "All the congregation of Israel shall keep it. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.12.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 12:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And when a stranger shall sojourn with you and would keep the passover to the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.12.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", let all his males be circumcised, then he may come near and keep it; he shall be as a native of the land. But no uncircumcised person shall eat of it. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.12.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 12:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
