          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Thus did all the people of Israel; as the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.12.50"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " commanded Moses and Aaron, so they did. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.12.50"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
